ITEM 2: SEESAW-TYPE ROBUSTNESS OF THE ALIGNMENT OBSTRUCTION
==============================================================================
  max relative deviation from M_nu proportional to f  [I    ]: 2.35e-15
  max relative deviation from M_nu proportional to f  [II   ]: 2.01e-16
  max relative deviation from M_nu proportional to f  [mixed]: 3.29e-15

  => In 120+126 ALL seesaw types give M_nu proportional to f, because
     M_D and M_R are both proportional to the single symmetric f.
     The obstruction is therefore INDEPENDENT of the seesaw mechanism.
     (This strengthens the paper: no type-I escape in the minimal content.)

