==============================================================================
  targets: m_s/m_b=0.022, m_d/m_b=0.0011, m_mu/m_tau=0.062, m_e/m_tau=0.00029, m_tau/m_b=1.6

  10+126           best |log resid| =   4.8853   m_tau/m_b =   1.601
  10+120+126       best |log resid| =   3.2465   m_tau/m_b =   1.531

  10+126 fitted ratios:
    m_s/m_b      target      0.022   fitted   0.041805
    m_d/m_b      target     0.0011   fitted  0.0048559
    m_mu/m_tau   target      0.062   fitted   0.067072
    m_e/m_tau    target    0.00029   fitted   0.029111
    m_tau/m_b    target        1.6   fitted     1.6011

  10+120+126 fitted ratios:
    m_s/m_b      target      0.022   fitted    0.12499
    m_d/m_b      target     0.0011   fitted  0.0033624
    m_mu/m_tau   target      0.062   fitted    0.27062
    m_e/m_tau    target    0.00029   fitted  0.0021968
    m_tau/m_b    target        1.6   fitted     1.5307

  Interpretation:
   - with a 10 present the diagonal identity is relaxed, so m_tau/m_b
     is no longer pinned near 3;
   - a small residual means the content CAN reproduce the observed
     charged ratios, i.e. it is phenomenologically viable, not merely
     structurally splitting.
